## Repository Structure

This repository uses a **crossroot** control plane{% if include_python %} with Python as the root orchestration layer{% endif %}.
Language islands: {% if include_python %}Python{% endif %}{% if include_typescript %}, TypeScript{% endif %}{% if include_java %}, Java{% endif %}.

```
{{ repo_slug }}/
├─ pyproject.toml        root control plane (deps, lint, type-check config)
├─ noxfile.py            task automation
├─ scripts/              repo orchestration scripts
│  └─ croot              command dispatcher
├─ docs/                 project documentation
│  └─ agent-src/         canonical source for agent instruction files
{% if include_python %}├─ python/               Python{% if python_mode == "workspace" %} workspace{% endif %} island
{% endif %}{% if include_typescript %}├─ typescript/           TypeScript island
{% endif %}{% if include_java %}├─ java/                 Java island
{% endif %}├─ CLAUDE.md             generated — do not edit directly
└─ AGENTS.md             generated — do not edit directly
```

> **Note:** `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, and `.cursor/rules/` are auto-generated from `docs/agent-src/`.
> Edit the source files there and run `croot gen-docs`.

## Root Commands

`croot` is a dispatcher script in `scripts/`. Add `scripts/` to your `PATH` after running `croot bootstrap`.

| Command | What it does |
|---------|-------------|
| `croot bootstrap` | Install prerequisites, sync deps, set up dev env |
| `croot check` | Run all quality checks across enabled modules |
{% if include_doctor_script %}| `croot doctor` | Diagnose environment: shell, OS, tools, config |
{% endif %}{% if include_update_script %}| `croot update` | Pull latest crossroot template changes via copier |
{% endif %}{% if include_agent_docs %}| `croot gen-docs` | Regenerate CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, .cursor/rules/ |
{% endif %}

Direct nox commands:

| Command | What it does |
|---------|-------------|
| `uv run nox -s lint` | Lint and format check |
{% if include_basedpyright %}| `uv run nox -s typecheck` | Type checking |
{% endif %}{% if include_pytest %}| `uv run nox -s test` | Run tests |
{% endif %}| `uv run nox -s check` | All of the above |
