## Python Island

{% if python_mode == "workspace" %}
Workspace mode: packages live in `python/apps/`, `python/libs/`, and `python/tools/`.
The root `pyproject.toml` defines the `[tool.uv.workspace]` members.
{% elif python_mode == "single-app" %}
Single-app mode: one application in `python/{{ python_default_app_name }}/`.
{% endif %}

Run all Python commands via `uv run` — never activate a virtualenv manually.
{% endif %}
{% if include_typescript %}

## TypeScript Island

Package manager: `{{ typescript_package_manager }}`. TypeScript tooling stays inside `typescript/`.
{% endif %}
